  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preservation of Ethnic Minority Manuscripts at Minzu University</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the preservation of more than 2,000 manuscripts of 15 Chinese ethnic minorities at Minzu University in Beijing. Folk culture and ethnic minority traditions are fading rapidly due to urbanization, and many languages are endangered. This project involves the cleaning, conservation, and proper storage of ancient and historic manuscripts and the preservation of the written language and the ethnic traditions they document.</narrative>
  </description>
